{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"There's a pause as she and the ravens are in quiet conversation. \"They already knew that but are glad to hear it anyway,\" she tells the Mender.","created_at":"2021-07-23T13:54:09.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868128860783378442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
