{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She points at Mictlan and Bo sleeping under trees, as well as Sabrine soaking in the pond. \"There's always someone here when I drop by. I think you've done a great job.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T13:56:24.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868129429031899137","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I have not done my job yet.... but its nice to have friends visit....\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T13:58:34.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868129972273954876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What is your job, Mr. Mender?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T13:59:05.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868130103543103548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"To mend... that which is damaging this city\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T13:59:28.486000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868130198854463538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I should have guessed from the title.\" She nods a bunch of times. \"Do you know what that is? Because I see a lot of broken things in this city but, not the source.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T14:02:20.705000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868130921193279488","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Thats the part that is..... bothersome.  Imagine being given the job of building a house.... without blueprints or tools....\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T14:03:14.909000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868131148541353994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"anyway.... what quest have you found yourself on?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T14:09:56.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868132831283527680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Do you know the twin ravens in Kingsbridge?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T14:10:33.881000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868132989723349062","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"yes.... I would call them revered friends.... ones I may not be close with.... but hold much respect for them\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T14:11:09.172000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T14:11:13.843000Z","id":"868133137744560168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
